===
# Manual Line Numbers

Specify exact lines to highlight:

```python [lines:'1-2|4']
# This is line 1
# This is line 2
# This is line 3
# This is line 4
# This is line 5
```

===
# Synchronized Code Fragments

Show code and explanation side-by-side with perfect synchronization

::: {display: 'grid'; grid-template-columns: '1fr 1fr'; gap: '2em'; align-items: 'start'}

```javascript [highlight:line-by-line]
function createSlide(title) {
    const slide = new Slide();
    slide.setTitle(title);
    slide.compile();
    return slide;
}
```

:::[sync-fragments keep]
Create a new slide object
[---]
Set the slide title
[---]
Compile to HTML
[---]
Return the generated slide
:::[sync-fragments]

:::

===
# Advanced Code Explanations

Build complex explanations step by step:

::: {display: 'grid'; grid-template-columns: '1fr 1fr'; gap: '2em'}

```python [highlight:line-by-line]
class Presentation:
    def __init__(self, title):
        self.title = title
        self.slides = []
    
    def add_slide(self, slide):
        self.slides.append(slide)
```

:::[sync-fragments keep]
**Step 1:** Define the Presentation class
[---]
**Step 2:** Initialize with title and empty slide list
[---]
**Step 3:** Add method to append slides to the presentation
:::[sync-fragments]

:::

