===

### Side to side for better graphical view

::: {calque: 1, horizontal-margin: -50, vertical-margin: 200}
,,,ide python
```
#!/usr/bin/env python3
import matplotlib.pyplot as plt
import numpy as np

x = np.linspace(0, 10, 100)
y = np.sin(x)

plt.plot(x, y, 'b-', linewidth=2)
plt.title('Simple Sinus')
plt.xlabel('x')
plt.ylabel('sin(x)')
plt.grid(True, alpha=0.3)
plt.show()
```
 output : "python-output-2",,,
:::

::: {calque: 1, horizontal-margin: 500, vertical-margin: 200}
output : "python-output-2"
:::

===

### Handle Javascript and SQL too !

::: {calque: 1, horizontal-margin: -50, vertical-margin: 130}
,,,ide javascript
```
#!/usr/bin/env node

function fibonacci(n) {
  if (n <= 1) return n;
  return fibonacci(n - 1) + fibonacci(n - 2);
}

for (let i = 0; i < 5; i++) {
  console.log(`F(${i}) = ${fibonacci(i)}`);
}
```
output : "javascript-output",,,
:::

::: {calque: 1, horizontal-margin: -50, vertical-margin: 500}
output : "javascript-output"
:::

::: {calque: 1, horizontal-margin: 500, vertical-margin: 130}
,,,ide sql 
```
CREATE TABLE users (id INT PRIMARY KEY, name VARCHAR(50));
INSERT INTO users (id, name) VALUES (1, 'Alice');
SELECT * FROM users;
```
output : "sql-output",,,
:::

::: {calque: 1, horizontal-margin: 500, vertical-margin: 500}
output : "sql-output"
:::

