# Feature 10: Live Preview with Monaco Editor

Real-time editing and preview for instant feedback!

::: {animate: "fade-in"}
**Start the development server**
```bash
slidedeckml dev my-presentation.sdml
```
:::

::: {animate: "fade-in"}
**Features:**
- Split-pane editor with live preview
- Monaco Editor (VS Code's editor engine)
- Instant compilation on every keystroke
- Automatic slide synchronization
- Syntax highlighting and IntelliSense
- Error messages with detailed feedback
:::

