===
# How It Works

## SlideDeckML Architecture

::: {animate: "fade-in"}
**1. Write** - Create `.sdml` files using our simple syntax
:::

::: {animate: "fade-in"}
**2. Parse** - Langium processes your DSL code
:::

::: {animate: "fade-in"}
**3. Generate** - Our compiler outputs Reveal.js HTML
:::

::: {animate: "fade-in"}
**4. Present** - Open in any browser and present!
:::

===
# Technology Stack

Built with modern, proven technologies

::: {display: 'grid'; grid-template-columns: '1fr 1fr'; gap: '25px'}
::: {background: '#0055A4'; color: 'white'; padding: '20px'; border-radius: '8px'; animate: 'fade-in'}
**Langium**

TypeScript-based DSL framework
:::

::: {background: '#1565C0'; color: 'white'; padding: '20px'; border-radius: '8px'; animate: 'fade-in'}
**Reveal.js**

HTML presentation library
:::

::: {background: '#1976D2'; color: 'white'; padding: '20px'; border-radius: '8px'; animate: 'fade-in'}
**VS Code**

Syntax highlighting extension
:::

::: {background: '#1E88E5'; color: 'white'; padding: '20px'; border-radius: '8px'; animate: 'fade-in'}
**Node.js**

CLI compiler and dev server
:::
:::

