# Quick Example

Creating a slide deck is this simple:

```plaintext [highlight:line-by-line]
{
    author: "Your Name"
    title: "My Awesome Presentation"
}
===
# Welcome

This is my first slide!

- Easy to write
- Beautiful output
- Version controlled
```

Compile with: `slidedeckml compile presentation.sdml`

===
# Benefits Summary

::: {background: '#ecf0f1'; padding: '20px'; border-radius: '10px'}
**vs. PowerPoint/Keynote:**
- Text-based means Git-friendly
- No proprietary formats
- Faster iteration
- Terminal-based workflow
:::

::: {background: '#ecf0f1'; padding: '20px'; border-radius: '10px'; margin-top: '20px'}
**vs. Plain Markdown:**
- 6 code highlighting modes
- Custom CSS styling
- Absolute positioning
- Animations and transitions
- Interactive features
:::

