===
# Try It Yourself!

Getting started is easy

::: {animate: "fade-in"}
**1. Install**
```bash
npm install -g slidedeckml
```
:::

::: {animate: "fade-in"}
**2. Create**
```bash
slidedeckml new my-presentation.sdml
```
:::

::: {animate: "fade-in"}
**3. Compile**
```bash
slidedeckml compile my-presentation.sdml
```
:::

::: {animate: "fade-in"}
**4. Present!**
Open the generated HTML in your browser
:::

